  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FJDP MAKURDI civic participation of PWDs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support the development of inclusive political processes to promote Disability inclusiveness in Electoral Processes for increased civic participation of persons with Disabilities by 2023.

This is an advocacy intervention that will map out and analyse relevant stakeholders to be engaged for the successful participation and empowerment of PWDs in the 2023 electoral processes.</narrative>
  </description>
